# The portfolio site — neither half belongs on this branch.
#
# website-src/  the site's source, built locally by `node scripts/build-pages.mjs`.
# website/      that build's output, published by `node scripts/deploy-pages.mjs` as a single
#               orphan commit on gh-pages. Committing it here instead would add its full weight
#               to main's history on every deploy, and none of it would ever be reclaimed.
/website-src/
/website/

# Python bytecode from the side projects
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Regenerated at the repository root every time the site installs or builds: lefthook walks
# up to the git root, so website-src/'s hooks keep landing here. The site has its own
# lefthook.yml; this one is an empty template and belongs to no one.
/lefthook.yml
